# Copy this file to ".env" in this same docker/ folder (docker compose auto-
# loads .env from the compose file's own directory) and set a real value --
# never commit the real .env (it is already covered by the repo's
# .gitignore rules for .env / .env.*, excluding this .example file).
#
# API_KEY is REQUIRED (2026-09-02 hardening) -- every /schema and /score
# endpoint on every service in this Mega Project requires this exact value
# in the request's X-API-Key header. Generate a real random key locally,
# e.g.:  python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
API_KEY=
